# Pairs with HandOffBound. Step (a) of the close is skipped: the initiator keeps
# admitting writes for the range after its close. A write admitted after the close
# carries the re-claimed generation, passes the raised entry, and is allocated
# above the recorded head.
MODULE: HandOffBoundAdmitAfterClose
TARGET: HandOffBound
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: the initiator admits a write after its close stopped admission
PERTURBS: ForeignAdmit

--- FIND
    /\ fAdmit
    /\ ~closing
    /\ ~fpend
--- REPLACE
\* MUTATION: admission does not stop at the close.
    /\ ~closing
    /\ ~fpend
--- END
